<title>UK: TENNIS-WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>EASTBOURNE, England 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Eastbourne women's grass-court tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-2</p>
<p>6-7#</p>
<p>(6-8) 6-4</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Nathalie Tauziat (France) 6-4</p>
<p>5-7 6-4</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>8-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat 1-Monica Seles</p>
<p>(U.S.) 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>4-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat 6-Irina Spirlea</p>
<p>(Romania) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Semifinal results:</p>
<p>Novotna beat Zvereva 6-7 (7-9) 6-0 7-5</p>
<p>Add semifinal results:</p>
<p>Sanchez Vicario beat Schultz-McCarthy 7-5 6-1</p>
</text>
